Package: stanSPsurv
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Split-Population Survival Models with Stan
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Sergio", "Béjar", email = "28761799+Sergio-Bejar@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Bumba", "Mukherjee", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Fits Bayesian split-population (cure) survival models with
    Weibull or log-logistic event-time distributions using Stan via
    'cmdstanr'. Provides pooled, exchangeable group-frailty, and scaled
    proper conditional autoregressive (CAR) spatial specifications through
    a common formula interface. Includes methods for coefficient
    extraction, prediction, frailty visualization, survival curves, and
    choropleth mapping of spatial effects.
